<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 105,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 105,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 94,000, Yr ago 107,000. Saturday's 10,000, 18,000 and 53,000, head respectively. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate to good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
